          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kfsjz",
              "fill": "#848484",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Labels are plural-neutral on purpose: the same string has to read correctly as a bucket heading (Building · $8.12 · 14 conversations) and as a single row stamp ([Engineering] · Building · 2 hours ago).",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "E54Lz",
              "fill": "#848484",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "An unrecognised slug — a workflow added after this ships — must fall back to Open chat rather than rendering the raw slug. A founder seeing drain-labeled-backlog in their billing page is the failure this map exists to prevent.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YaSa0",
              "fill": "#848484",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Shipping end to end and Building are deliberately distinct: one-shot runs the whole arc unattended, work executes an already-approved plan. If the founder can only ever tell them apart by cost, the labels have failed.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
